# Environment variables for the Credit Card Optimiser.
#
# DEFAULT (Ollama / offline): you need NOTHING here — leave this file empty or
# don't create .env at all. The model runs locally via Ollama.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — Ollama Cloud (https://ollama.com) for TESTING without a local GPU.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Point config/model.config at the hosted endpoint (uncomment the Ollama Cloud
# block there, i.e. OLLAMA_API_BASE=https://ollama.com) and put your key below.
# It is attached as `Authorization: Bearer <key>` ONLY for a remote (non-local)
# OLLAMA_API_BASE — a local daemon stays credential-free. Copy this file to .env
# (git-ignored) and set:
# OLLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=your_ollama_cloud_key_here
#
# NOTE: cloud sends your transaction reasoning off-device, so this trades away
# the offline/privacy guarantee — use it for testing, not daily use.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — Gemini (NOT offline).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only required if you switch config/model.config to MODEL_PROVIDER=gemini
# (the optional cloud path). Copy this file to .env and fill in ONE option:
#
#   Option A — Gemini API key (from Google AI Studio):
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
#
#   Option B — Vertex AI (GCP project with billing + Application Default Creds):
# GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_VERTEXAI=TRUE
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=your-gcp-region
